WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:02.210
Unfortunately,

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:05.630
we can't be together
as long as you think that way.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:09.801
I think it's best if we
try this again another time.

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:12.262
Now get out of here.

00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:15.223
No.

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:17.517
What?

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:20.645
This is the Shaman King's commune!

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:23.064
My will is everything in this world!

00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:25.191
I can't leave.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.986
Not until I do something about you.

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:29.821
It can't be!

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:32.949
You also have the Shaman King's power?

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.201
Not just him.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:37.412
Tao Ren!

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:39.956
I'm here too.

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:42.834
Horokeu Usui!

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:44.419
And us!

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:47.130
Joco McDonnell!

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:48.506
Lyserg Diethel!

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.258
We're in the afterlife,

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.385
so you've got the seeing version of me!

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:55.388
I see.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.140
The Five Grand Elemental Spirits.

00:00:57.974 --> 00:01:00.018
You're able to enter this place

00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:03.605
because you have the power of those
who make up the Great Spirit!

00:01:03.688 --> 00:01:04.981
More or less.

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:10.153
But we only obtained them after we
were already inside the Great Spirit.

00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:14.032
Thanks to you killing everyone!

00:01:14.157 --> 00:01:16.326
Now, since we're here,
want a taste of our power?

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:18.536
Over Soul!

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:20.580
Spirit of Thunder!

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:25.877
Gather and blot out the heavens,
black cumulonimbus clouds!

00:01:26.836 --> 00:01:28.546
Nine Dragon Exploding Thunder!

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:35.053
You killed us all,
knowing this would happen, didn't you?

00:01:35.178 --> 00:01:37.889
Over Soul! Spirit of Rain!

00:01:38.556 --> 00:01:39.891
Let the downpour begin!

00:01:40.016 --> 00:01:43.478
Have some of this!
Porowaok Ererupus Shinupuri!

00:01:45.647 --> 00:01:48.608
You can't say you didn't have this coming!

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:49.901
Over Soul!

00:01:50.026 --> 00:01:51.736
Spirit of Wind!

00:01:51.861 --> 00:01:55.323
The name comes from a wind god…

00:01:55.865 --> 00:01:56.741
Now, blow it all away,

00:01:57.867 --> 00:02:00.745
God Breath Hurricane!

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:06.167
Over Soul! Spirit of Fire!

00:02:06.209 --> 00:02:08.503
Not even the flames of hell

00:02:08.586 --> 00:02:11.047
are hot enough
for a spoiled brat like you!

00:02:11.172 --> 00:02:12.215
Take this!

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:14.300
Magma Uppercut!

00:02:15.593 --> 00:02:16.761
Amazing…

